1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,360
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,720
=The One=

16
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,280
=Episode 21=

17
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,500
(Five years later)

18
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,670
Here's the divorce agreement.

19
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:37,920
My client has just one condition.

20
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,560
She wants custody of the child.

21
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:40,560
Fine.

22
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:42,320
But I have one condition.

23
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,710
She leaves with nothing.

24
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,710
And pays me 20 million yuan.

25
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,710
You... you're shameless.

26
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:50,430
You're the one who cheated!

27
00:00:50,430 --> 00:00:50,750
You...

28
00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:57,150
Wangfu Garden, Apt. 1901.

29
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:58,182
Every month,

30
00:00:58,183 --> 00:00:59,640
you give influencer Ms. Li 200,000 yuan.

31
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:01,390
A college student at No. 9 Wutong Court.

32
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:02,600
80,000 yuan a month.

33
00:01:02,790 --> 00:01:03,750
Last month at a nightclub,

34
00:01:04,070 --> 00:01:05,870
you assaulted a server.

35
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:06,710
I have the video.

36
00:01:06,950 --> 00:01:09,040
You'd be looking at three to five years.

37
00:01:09,510 --> 00:01:10,640
I'll submit the HD copy

38
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,760
as evidence in court.

39
00:01:23,070 --> 00:01:23,950
Who are you?

40
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,040
What, playing the hero?

41
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:48,790
Mr. Wang.

42
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,350
You owe 20 million in gambling debts
back in Aocheng.

43
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:54,350
Planning to use her money to pay it off?

44
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:55,350
You're...

45
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,480
Mr. Cheng.

46
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:57,760
Mr. Cheng!

47
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,230
Give me one more month.

48
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:00,710
I'll pay you back. I promise.

49
00:02:01,230 --> 00:02:03,350
If you hadn't hit her just now,

50
00:02:04,230 --> 00:02:05,400
we might've had room to negotiate.

51
00:02:07,870 --> 00:02:09,080
You're with Mr. Cheng?

52
00:02:12,710 --> 00:02:14,960
I'll sign! I'll sign! I'll sign!

53
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,400
I'll sign! I'll sign!

54
00:02:19,150 --> 00:02:20,560
Just give me one month!

55
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,520
I'll sign! I'll sign!

56
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:26,750
Are you still living at...

57
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,030
I'll have my driver take you.

58
00:02:30,870 --> 00:02:31,870
Someone's picking me up.

59
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:33,750
No need, Mr. Cheng.

60
00:02:41,310 --> 00:02:41,960
Mom!

61
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:43,680
We've been waiting forever!

62
00:02:50,590 --> 00:02:51,710
Sorry to keep you waiting.

63
00:02:53,750 --> 00:02:54,400
Mr. Cheng.

64
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:15,710
(Mom, Daddy picked me up today)

65
00:03:15,710 --> 00:03:17,520
(and bought me lots of yummy snacks.)

66
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:25,150
Thanks for picking Tangtang up.

67
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,800
But you shouldn't have Tangtang

68
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,680
calling you Dad.

69
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,750
Is Tangtang's father...

70
00:03:36,710 --> 00:03:37,520
Cheng Lin?

71
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:38,680
I told you.

72
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:40,430
I adopted Tangtang.

73
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,390
I'll take her back

74
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,950
to the children's home.

75
00:03:51,425 --> 00:03:53,435
Thank you for all you've done, Ms. Su.

76
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,190
I only did

77
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:58,700
what any lawyer should do.

78
00:03:58,975 --> 00:04:00,460
She may not have come into this world

79
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:01,990
the way her parents

80
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:02,870
had hoped,

81
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,190
but I want her to know

82
00:04:05,190 --> 00:04:06,415
her mother was very brave.

83
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,630
I hope she grows up

84
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:11,735
happy and carefree.

85
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:14,590
Don't worry. We'll take care of her.

86
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,590
Whenever you have time, Ms. Su,

87
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:16,870
come visit her.

88
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:18,550
I will.

89
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,150
Whenever we can,

90
00:04:19,150 --> 00:04:21,050
we'll come visit the children.

91
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,150
Sir.

92
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,350
Can I adopt her?

93
00:04:47,900 --> 00:04:48,660
(Su Yan.)

94
00:04:49,620 --> 00:04:50,860
(Tell me.)

95
00:04:51,300 --> 00:04:53,285
(What would make you feel better?)

96
00:04:53,340 --> 00:04:56,740
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

97
00:04:56,740 --> 00:05:00,260
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

98
00:05:00,260 --> 00:05:03,780
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

99
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:07,540
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

100
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:26,020
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

101
00:05:26,020 --> 00:05:29,660
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

102
00:05:29,660 --> 00:05:32,860
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

103
00:05:32,860 --> 00:05:36,540
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

104
00:05:36,540 --> 00:05:39,940
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

105
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:43,620
♪I hum this song alone♪

106
00:05:43,620 --> 00:05:47,460
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

107
00:05:47,460 --> 00:05:51,540
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

108
00:05:51,540 --> 00:05:54,820
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

109
00:05:54,820 --> 00:05:58,420
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

110
00:05:58,420 --> 00:06:01,900
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

111
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:06,780
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
